1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,140
Our camp stood near the Tropic of Capricorn.

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:08,556
The days were warm and humid, but the higher ground was mild, with more moderate temperatures.

3
00:00:08,556 --> 00:00:13,420
One side of the plateau was arid; the other had moist soil and damp stones.

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,875
Far above, a snowy peak still carried frost.

5
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:20,113
At night, we used heating and thermal blankets.

6
00:00:20,113 --> 00:00:23,011
By morning, the team had repaired the pipe.

7
00:00:23,011 --> 00:00:25,193
Water returned to the brook.

8
00:00:25,193 --> 00:00:30,806
The village had not needed a miracle: it had needed careful observation and a practical repair.

